msgstr "gmeow:relationshipParentFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:relationshipParent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipChildFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:relationshipChild and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:relationshipChild (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:relationshipChild 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:relationshipChild 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/relationshipParentFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:relationshipParent and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:relationshipParent (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:relationshipParent 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:relationshipParent 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/genealogy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment"
msgid "A comprehensive, evidence-centric genealogy model: reified, typed kinship relationships and kinship convenience properties. Life events themselves are modelled by the universal events module (gmeow:Event + gmeow:eventType value vocabulary + the gmeow:Participation relator); a person's life events are gmeow:LifeEvent occurrences carrying gmeow:eventTypeBirth / …Marriage / …NameChange etc. Structured naming terms (gmeow:PersonName et al.) live in the names module and link to the event that confers them via gmeow:conferredByEvent. Supersedes the unmaintained W3C SWAP gedcom vocabulary; aligned to BIO, GEDCOM X, schema.org, Wikidata, REL and GeoNames.\n\nSTANDPOINT DOCTRINE. Contested facts in genealogy — disputed parentage, conflicting birth/death dates, competing civil vs parish records — are standpoint-indexed claims that COEXIST, none privileged (Principle 9). A contested birth date is two standpoint-indexed gmeow:eventTime claims on the same gmeow:LifeEvent (the events module's mechanism). A contested parentage is two gmeow:accordingTo-annotated gmeow:hasParent claims, or two reified gmeow:ParentChildRelationship instances each carrying gmeow:accordingTo. There is NO genealogy-specific dispute mechanism, no preferredParent, no primaryKinship — only the cross-cutting standpoint facility. A parentage claim its own holder withdrew (a StandpointTenure whose held claim its holder retracted, or a claim its holder superseded) sets gmeow:displayable false, never deletion (Principle 10); a tenure that merely closed takes no flag, and a claim another party disputes or corrects takes none either."
msgstr "一个全面的、以证据为中心的系谱模型：具体化的、带类型的亲属关系，以及亲属关系便利属性。生命事件本身由通用事件模块建模（gmeow:Event + gmeow:eventType 取值词表 + gmeow:Participation 关系体）；某人的生命事件是带有 gmeow:eventTypeBirth / …Marriage / …NameChange 等的 gmeow:LifeEvent 发生。结构化的命名术语（gmeow:PersonName 等）位于名称模块，并通过 gmeow:conferredByEvent 链接到授予它们的事件。取代无人维护的 W3C SWAP gedcom 词表；与 BIO、GEDCOM X、schema.org、Wikidata、REL 和 GeoNames 对齐。\n\n立场学说。系谱中的有争议事实——有争议的亲子关系、相互矛盾的出生/死亡日期、相互竞争的民事与教区记录——是按立场索引的声明，它们共存（COEXIST），无一享有特权（原则 9）。有争议的出生日期是同一 gmeow:LifeEvent 上两条按立场索引的 gmeow:eventTime 声明（事件模块的机制）。有争议的亲子关系是两条带 gmeow:accordingTo 标注的 gmeow:hasParent 声明，或两个各自带有 gmeow:accordingTo 的具体化 gmeow:ParentChildRelationship 实例。系谱没有专属的争议机制，没有 preferredParent，也没有 primaryKinship——只有横切的立场设施。其持有者自己撤回的亲子声明（一个其所持声明已被其持有者撤销的 gmeow:StandpointTenure，或其持有者已取代的声明）设置 gmeow:displayable false，绝不删除（原则 10），即对读者隐藏；仅仅结束的任期不带标志，另一方提出异议或更正的声明同样不带标志。"
